# WF-5: Session Management

## Mermaid Source

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as Auth API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    == Create Session ==

    U->>A: POST /auth/login (username, password)
    A->>DB: SELECT user WHERE username
    DB-->>A: user record

    alt MFA not required
        A->>DB: INSERT session (token_jti, expires_at)
        A-->>U: 200 {access_token, refresh_token}
    else MFA required
        A-->>U: 200 MFA_REQUIRED
        U->>A: POST /mfa/verify
        A->>DB: INSERT session
        A-->>U: 200 {access_token, refresh_token}
    end

    == Token Refresh ==

    U->>A: POST /auth/refresh (refresh_token)
    A->>DB: SELECT session WHERE refresh_token_hash=?

    alt valid + not expired
        A->>DB: UPDATE session (new expires_at)
        A-->>U: 200 {access_token}
    else expired/revoked
        A-->>U: 401 TOKEN_EXPIRED
    end

    == Logout (Single Session) ==

    U->>A: POST /auth/logout (access_token)
    A->>DB: UPDATE session (revoked_at = NOW())
    A-->>U: 200 {logged_out: true}

    == Logout (All Sessions) ==

    U->>A: POST /auth/logout-all
    A->>DB: UPDATE session WHERE user_id (revoked_at = NOW())
    A-->>U: 200 {logged_out_all: true, sessions_revoked: N}

    == List Sessions ==

    U->>A: GET /api/v1/sessions
    A->>DB: SELECT sessions WHERE user_id = current_user_id
    DB-->>A: [sessions...]
    A-->>U: 200 {sessions: [...]}

    == Revoke Own Session ==

    U->>A: DELETE /api/v1/sessions/{id}
    alt own session
        A->>DB: UPDATE session (revoked_at = NOW())
        A-->>U: 200 {revoked: true}
    else not own
        A-->>U: 403 FORBIDDEN
    end
```

## Session Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph Login["Login Flow"]
        L["POST /auth/login"] --> U{User<br/>exists?}
        U --> |no| E["401 Invalid"]
        U --> |yes| P{Password<br/>correct?}
        P --> |no| E
        P --> |yes| MFA{MFA<br/>required?}
        MFA --> |yes| MFAV["POST /mfa/verify"]
        MFA --> |no| CS["Create Session"]
        MFAV --> CS
    end

    subgraph Token["Token Lifecycle"]
        CS --> AT["Access Token<br/>(15 min)"]
        AT --> RE{Refresh?}
        RE --> |yes| RT["POST /auth/refresh"]
        RT --> AT
        RE --> |expired| L
    end

    subgraph Logout["Logout"]
        AT --> LOG["POST /auth/logout"]
        LOG --> RL["Revoke Session"]
        RL --> DONE["Logged Out"]
    end

    style Login fill:#d4edda
    style Token fill:#fff3cd
    style Logout fill:#f8d7da
```

## API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Mô tả |
|--------|----------|--------|
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/login` | Đăng nhập, tạo session |
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/refresh` | Refresh access token |
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/logout` | Logout session hiện tại |
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/logout-all` | Logout tất cả sessions |
| GET | `/api/v1/sessions` | List active sessions |
| DELETE | `/api/v1/sessions/{id}` | Revoke một session |
| POST | `/api/v1/admin/sessions/{id}/revoke` | Admin revoke session |

## Token Configuration

| Token | Lifetime | Storage |
|-------|----------|---------|
| Access Token | 15 minutes | JWT (stateless) |
| Refresh Token | 7 days | PostgreSQL (hashed) |
| MFA Session | 5 minutes | PostgreSQL |

## Session States

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active: INSERT session
    Active --> Active: UPDATE last_activity
    Active --> Revoked: POST /logout
    Active --> Expired: expires_at reached
    Revoked --> [*]
    Expired --> [*]
```
